ReelsVault transcribes saved Reels, classifies each one's hooks, calls to action and proof points, and makes the whole library searchable by meaning. You can chat with it to find what makes things go viral, and export everything to Obsidian.

It runs locally on faster-whisper with GPT-4o-mini or a local Ollama model.
